OL,3,GNEWSAPolice investigate death of man in
OL,4,Ahis 30s after 'incident at house'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetectives are investigating the
OL,7,Fcircumstances surrounding the death of
OL,8,Fa man in his 30s in County Down, the
OL,9,FPolice Service of Northern Ireland
OL,10,F(PSNI) have said.
OL,12,FThe man was taken to hospital following
OL,13,Fan "incident at a house" at Stratheden
OL,14,FHeights in Newtownards on Monday 7
OL,15,FSeptember.
OL,17,FHowever he died on Sunday.
OL,19,FThe PSNI have no further details at
OL,20,Fthis time.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
